{"title": "Natural Pugilist", "pageid": 27931, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Natural_Pugilist", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Natural Pugilist</b> is a passive feature that increases the user's unarmed attack rolls and damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain a +1 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee Unarmed Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee Unarmed <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Corellon%27s_Grace\" title=\"Corellon's Grace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Magic_Staff_B_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Corellon%27s_Grace\" title=\"Corellon's Grace\">Corellon's Grace</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Unarmed attack bonuses granted by Natural Pugilist are still useful if a <a href=\"/wiki/Monk\" title=\"Monk\">monk</a> is equipped with <a href=\"/wiki/Corellon%27s_Grace\" title=\"Corellon's Grace\">Corellon's Grace</a>, since monks can perform various unarmed attack actions (e.g., <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike_(Monk)\" title=\"Unarmed Strike (Monk)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Unarmed_Strike_Monk_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmed_Strike_Monk_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Unarmed_Strike_Monk_Icon.webp/30px-Unarmed_Strike_Monk_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Unarmed_Strike_Monk_Icon.webp/40px-Unarmed_Strike_Monk_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unarmed Strike (Monk)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Unarmed_Strike_Monk_Icon.webp/20px-Unarmed_Strike_Monk_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Unarmed_Strike_Monk_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unarmed_Strike_(Monk)\" title=\"Unarmed Strike (Monk)\">Unarmed Strike (Monk)</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows\" title=\"Flurry of Blows\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp/20px-Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp/30px-Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp/40px-Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flurry of Blows\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp/20px-Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Flurry_of_Blows_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows\" title=\"Flurry of Blows\">Flurry of Blows</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Resonation:_Punch\" title=\"Ki Resonation: Punch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Ki_Resonation_Punch_Icon.webp/20px-Ki_Resonation_Punch_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Ki_Resonation_Punch_Icon.webp/30px-Ki_Resonation_Punch_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Ki_Resonation_Punch_Icon.webp/40px-Ki_Resonation_Punch_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ki Resonation: Punch\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Ki_Resonation_Punch_Icon.webp/20px-Ki_Resonation_Punch_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Ki_Resonation_Punch_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Resonation:_Punch\" title=\"Ki Resonation: Punch\">Ki Resonation: Punch</a>) even when equipped with a melee weapon, as long as it is a <a href=\"/wiki/Monk_weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monk weapon\">monk weapon</a>.</li>\n<li>When using an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/40px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp/20px-Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Improvised_Melee_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improvised_Melee_Weapon\" title=\"Improvised Melee Weapon\">Improvised Melee Weapon</a>, which is considered an unarmed melee attack, Natural Pugilist grants the bonus to the attack roll but not to the damage roll.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1910/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17288/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7006/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 965538/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.893      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   42.893      1 -total\n 33.89%   14.537      5 Template:Icon_text\n 30.24%   12.972     16 Template:Trim\n 28.74%   12.328      1 Template:Passive_weapon